tent":"事見文帝十三年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"事见文帝十三年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee605-db0e-11ef-9d62-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孟康","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟康","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee608-db0e-11ef-a0a2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"孟康曰：重罪，謂死刑。","note_content_jianti_auto":"孟康曰：重罪，谓死刑。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee607-db0e-11ef-91d3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee60a-db0e-11ef-8455-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：謂不能自起居也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：谓不能自起居也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee609-db0e-11ef-94d4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-202,"link_death_year":-157,"link_td_description":"汉文帝刘恒，中国汉朝（西汉）初期皇帝，于公元前180年至前157年在位，共23年，庙号太宗，正式谥号为“孝文皇帝”，后世省略“孝”字称为“汉文帝”。其系汉高祖刘邦第四子，母亲是汉高祖薄姬（即薄太后），墓葬是汉霸陵（位于今陕西省西安市灞桥区白鹿原）。汉文帝是中国历史上第一位经由推选出来的皇帝，也是一位贤良、节俭、恤民及治国有方的君主，与其子汉景帝共同创造了中国历史上大一统时代的首个盛世“文景之治”。","link_td_id":"Q10000348","link_td_number_id":38105,"people_name":"文帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"文帝","people_xingming":"刘恒","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee60b-db0e-11ef-997c-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘恒]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"5初，文帝除肉刑，外有輕刑之名，內實殺人；斬右止者又當死；斬左止者笞五百，當劓者笞三百，率多死。是歲，下詔曰：「加笞與重罪無異；幸而不死，不可爲人。其定律：笞五百曰三百，笞三百曰二百。」","content_fanyi":"当初汉文帝取消肉刑，表面上有减轻刑罚的名声，暗中反而害死更多人：原判斩去右脚趾的改为死刑；斩去左脚趾的改为笞打五百下，应割鼻的改为笞打三百下，受刑的人大多因此死亡。这一年，汉景帝颁诏说：“笞打数加得太多，与处死没有差别；即使侥幸活命，也落下残疾，无法维持生计。现规定：原本笞打五百下的减为三百下，原本笞打三百下的减为二百下。”","content_jianti_auto":"5初，文帝除肉刑，外有轻刑之名，内实杀人；斩右止者又当死；斩左止者笞五百，当劓者笞三百，率多死。是岁，下诏曰：「加笞与重罪无异；幸而不死，不可为人。其定律：笞五百曰三百，笞三百曰二百。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1228,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee604-db0e-11ef-889d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孟康","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟康","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee60e-db0e-11ef-b694-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"孟康曰：歐，音驅；索隱曰：於后翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"孟康曰：欧，音驱；索隐曰：于后翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee60d-db0e-11ef-979a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee611-db0e-11ef-8db2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"平陸","place_name_jianti_auto":"平陆","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee612-db0e-11ef-967a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"戰國","place_name_jianti_auto":"战国","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee613-db0e-11ef-b25d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee614-db0e-11ef-87a3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東平國","place_name_jianti_auto":"东平国","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee615-db0e-11ef-9996-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東平陸縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"东平陆县","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee616-db0e-11ef-8b90-a0d3651